<Layout title="How DSCR Financing Works | YourBrokerPal" description="Understand the steps involved in financing your next rental property with YourBrokerPal.">
<div class="page"><div class="kicker">HOW IT WORKS</div><h1>A clear path from property idea to financing.</h1><p class="lead">Every transaction is different. We keep the process focused on the property, your goals, and the information needed to explore financing.</p><div class="steps"><article><b>01</b><div><h2>Start the conversation</h2><p>Tell us whether you're purchasing or refinancing, where the property is located, and what you're looking to accomplish.</p></div></article><article><b>02</b><div><h2>Review the scenario</h2><p>We'll discuss the property, estimated rental income, requested loan amount, and the information needed to evaluate potential options.</p></div></article><article><b>03</b><div><h2>Gather your documentation</h2><p>When appropriate, we'll outline the documents and property details needed to move forward. Please do not email sensitive financial documents unless we have provided a secure method.</p></div></article><article><b>04</b><div><h2>Move through underwriting</h2><p>Loan terms, conditions, and timing depend on the selected lender's guidelines, underwriting, and approval.</p></div></article></div><div class="cta"><h2>Have a property in mind?</h2><p>Start with a short inquiry and we'll take it from there.</p><a href="/apply">Start a Loan Inquiry →</a></div></div>
</Layout>
<style>.page{max-width:850px;margin:auto;padding:35px 0 70px}.kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#078f9d;font-weight:800}.page h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,56px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2px;color:#10243c;margin:20px 0}.lead{font-size:18px;color:#617387;line-height:1.8}.steps{margin-top:42px;display:grid;gap:16px}.steps article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:55px 1fr;gap:18px;background:#f0f3f5;padding:24px}.steps article>b{font-size:23px;color:#079eaa}.steps h2{font-size:21px;color:#10243c;margin:0 0 7px}.steps p{font-size:15px;color:#627487;margin:0}.cta{margin-top:40px;background:#10243c;padding:30px;color:white}.cta h2{color:white}.cta p{color:#c5d1dc}.cta a{color:#62c9bd;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none}</style>